SUMMARY:A Charlie Brown Christmas
LOCATION:The Burren\, 247 Elm St\, Somerville\, MA 02144
DESCRIPTION:Come experience the magic of the season as a live jazz piano tr
 io brings A Charlie Brown Christmas to life on stage! This heartwarming pe
 rformance captures the nostalgic charm of Vince Guaraldi’s iconic soundt
 rack\, featuring beloved tunes like “Linus and Lucy\,” “Christmas Ti
 me Is Here\,” and more. Performed with improvised\, authentic arrangemen
 ts and the warm energy of live musicianship\, this show is a joyful celebr
 ation for all ages—perfect for fans of Snoopy\, jazz lovers\, and anyone
  who wants to embrace the holiday spirit. Bring your friends and family fo
 r an unforgettable day of timeless music and festive cheer!\nhttps://ticke
